reference-goldens.jsonl
=======================

248 existing serving-level cases refreshed from the model builder's current golden corpus,
lib/response-template/tests/data/{generated,tags}.jsonl at commit
1e879cf56b5aaf0bf609a65738cf6b44599ce4f0. Inputs and expected results are copied unchanged,
retaining the original id / source / prefix / chunks / tools / serving / serving_batch fields.
The source now records complete prompt histories. No new case IDs were added. Forty former
cases now use explicit legacy template variants and are excluded by the original rule:
keep only cases whose template is absent or equal to the current built-in Beam template.

The results were independently re-recorded with SGLang f7473673d in the released image
nvcr.io/nvidia/ai-dynamo/sglang-runtime@sha256:aec648ae2e18cef309920f9fe8afe52ee02c856a5ffb469ca90c9f0628c571d8,
with the Beam tool-name class spelled [^ \t\n\r\f\v<]+ as in the current template,
and XGrammar 0.2.7. They are reference results, not output captured from a Dynamo parser.
Remaining differences are documented in reference-known-divergences.yaml and checked
in both directions by beam_reference_goldens.rs.

